description	"Commander Col Serra

^2Weaponry:
- Shotgun (1)
-- Mag Reload
- Modified DL-44 Blaster Pistol (3)
-- Primary Fire Only
-- 50% Faster RoF
-- Passive ammo regen
- 3 Thermal Grenades
- 1 Frag Grenade

^8Attributes:
- Increased energy pool
- Heal (3)
- Rally

^3Abilities:
- Battle Command (Protects himself and teammates)
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]
- Dash (3) ^3[CS2]

Col Serra was a smuggler who operated during the Galactic Civil War and was an old friend of Han Solo. 
At Solo's request Serra formed a unit of trained soldiers for the Rebellion, which consisted of various scoundrels, pirates, bounty hunters, and other outlaws. The unit under Serra's leadership would later be known as Renegade Squadron and operated in most of the Galactic Civil War's key events, such as evacuation of Yavin 4, Battle of Hoth and Battle of Endor."